  "content": "<h1>SlashBlade Inspect - 拔刀剑视检</h1><p>为经典的拔刀剑（SlashBlade）模组带来帅气的武器视检功能！</p><h2>目前提供的特性：</h2><ul>\n<li>按下 <strong>G</strong> 键即可触发拔刀剑的视检（Inspect）动画，全方位欣赏你的爱刀。</li>\n<li>丝滑且极具沉浸感的局内武器观赏体验。</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>有想法或发现Bug，请前往：</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues · Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>或</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests · Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Github仓库：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect: 在Minecraft中按下G键视检你的拔刀剑！</a></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>开源协议：</strong></span> <strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT许可证</a></span></strong></p><p>————————————————————————————————————</p><p>为经典的拔刀剑（SlashBlade）模组带来帅气的武器视检功能！</p><h5>目前提供的特性：</h5><ul>\n<li>按下 <strong>G</strong> 键即可触发拔刀剑的视检（Inspect）动作，全方位欣赏你的爱刀。</li>\n<li>丝滑且极具沉浸感的局内武器观赏体验。</li>\n</ul><h5><strong>有想法或bug，请：</strong></h5><p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues · Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></span></strong></p><p><strong>或</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Moflop/SlashBladeInspect/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests · Moflop/SlashBlade-Inspect</a></strong></span></p><h5><strong>Github:</strong></h5><p>